      "message": "refactor(sim): law (d)'s prior readers read the stock through Columns\n\nverify::prior_surface and verify::acquit_by_prior took &Dexel; they now\ntake &Columns, the M7.3 column seam a column or field Stock already\nanswers through. Columns gains of_grid (a bare rest grid, borrowed) and\ncell/center/origin; the operation layer wraps its program-ahead grid\nuntil #586 moves that holder onto Stock. Behaviour-neutral: the four\nverify::prior unit tests pass unchanged; the new prior_columns suite\nshows a column stock, a field stock and a bare grid read the same prior\nsurface and acquit the same dives.\n\nFixes #585\nRefs #26\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX",
