      "message": "refactor(app): the operation priors read the stock through Columns\n\n#586 step 1 (M7.3 3/6): prior_top (top_stock), revolved_surface\n(drill_prior) and columns_reach (carried_stock) took &Dexel; they now\nread through the Columns seam (#585) - same lattice formulas, so the\nanswers are unchanged. Callers wrap their grid with Columns::of_grid\nuntil step 2 moves the holders onto Stock.\n\nRefs #586\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX",
